#: Services/CorsJSLocalizer.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Cors.Services.CorsJSLocalizer"
msgid ""
"Allows credentials to be transported in requests. This setting is not "
"allowed in combination with Allow Any Origin."
msgstr "允许在请求中传输凭据。此设置不能与“允许任意来源”同时使用。"

#: Services/CorsJSLocalizer.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Cors.Services.CorsJSLocalizer"
msgid ""
"Allows requests from any origin. This will bypass any origin that is "
"configured below."
msgstr "允许来自任意来源的请求。此设置会绕过下方配置的所有来源。"

#: Services/CorsJSLocalizer.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Cors.Services.CorsJSLocalizer"
msgid ""
"Allows requests with any header. This will bypass any headers that are "
"configured below."
msgstr "允许使用任意标头的请求。此设置会绕过下方配置的所有标头。"

#: Services/CorsJSLocalizer.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Cors.Services.CorsJSLocalizer"
msgid ""
"Allows requests with any method. This will bypass any methods that are "
"configured below."
msgstr "允许使用任意方法的请求。此设置会绕过下方配置的所有方法。"

